      "sourceParagraphs": 169,
      "translatedParagraphs": 169,
      "sourceChars": 19056,
      "translationChars": 6334,
      "firstParagraph": {
        "source": "There was one last drop of chocolate milkshake in my cup, but no matter how I moved my straw, I just couldn't reach it. I was pretty certain that the people sitting in the booth next to us were watching me with raised eyebrows, but that didn't matter to me. What mattered was that I had just chugged the best milkshake of my entire life.",
        "translation": "杯子里还剩最后一滴巧克力奶昔，可无论我怎么挪动吸管，就是吸不到。我十分肯定隔壁卡座的人正扬着眉毛看我，但我根本不在乎。重要的是，我刚刚咕咚咕咚喝完了这辈子最棒的一杯奶昔。",
        "checked": true
      },
      "lastParagraph": {
        "source": "I'd never been to a party before, but I knew—instinctively—that this one was over.",
        "translation": "我从没来过派对，但我凭直觉知道——这场派对，结束了。",
        "checked": true
      },
