      "firstParagraph": {
        "source": "Somewhere in the crowd, a chant started: *Fight! Fight! Fight!*",
        "translation": "人群中某处，有人开始喊起口号：*打！打！打！*",
        "checked": true
      },
      "lastParagraph": {
        "source": "I shuffled upstairs and into the guest room—*my* room—and wondered if I'd ever feel like anything but an outsider in this strange, ungodly humid town.",
        "translation": "我拖着脚步上了楼，走进客房——*我的*房间——心里想着，在这个陌生、湿热得不像话的小镇上，我是否终有一天能不再觉得自己是个外人。",
        "checked": true
